  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jumpline::Jumpline.UI.LocalizedText
  key: 'Your runner moves forward on its own.


    SWIPE UP to jump.

    SWIPE DOWN to slide, or to drop fast from the air.

    SWIPE LEFT / RIGHT to change lanes.


    When Tepegoz chases you, tap THROW to hit him with melons. Four hits and he falls!


    Crash into an obstacle and the run ends. Retry instantly and beat the level!'
